hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wisal [baghair iftar ke lagatar roza rakhne] se mana farmaya. To kaha gaya: Beshak Aap wisal farmate hain? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main tum jaise nahin hun: Beshak mujhe khilaya aur pilaya jata hai.'"
"332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Wisal se bacho, wisal se bacho, wisal se bacho.' Logon ne kaha: Beshak Aap wisal farmate hain, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main tumhari haalat jaise nahin hun: Beshak main raat guzarta hun [is haal mein] ke mera Rabb mujhe khilata aur pilata hai.'"
"333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wisal farmaya to unhon [sahaba] ne bhi wisal kiya. Phir [khabar] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar yeh mahina mere liye lamba kar diya jata to main aisa wisal farmata ke ghulu karne wale apna ghulu chhor dete. Beshak main tum jaise nahin hun: Beshak mera Rabb mujhe khilata aur pilata hai.'"
